@startuml class-after
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 110
skinparam nodesep 90

interface Cell <<interface>> {
  + figureNextState()
  + transition()
  + redraw()
  + userClicked()
  + transfer()
  + colorAt()
  + holdNextState()
  + create()
}

class Neighborhood {
  - gridSize
  + transition()
  + redraw()
}

class Resident {
  ~ {static} LIVE_COLOR
  - amAlive
  - willBeAlive
  - age
  - heldThisGeneration
  ~ {static} setColorPolicy()
  ~ {static} colorChangesWithAge()
  + transition()
  + redraw()
  + userClicked()
  + transfer()
  + colorAt()
  + holdNextState()
}

interface CellColorPolicy <<interface>> {
  + colorOf()
  + changesWithAge()
}

class FixedColorPolicy {
  - color
  + FixedColorPolicy()
  + colorOf()
  + changesWithAge()
}

class CyclingColorPolicy {
  - period
  - colors
  + CyclingColorPolicy()
  + colorOf()
  + changesWithAge()
}

class Universe {
  - {static} theInstance
  + {static} instance()
  # paintComponent()
  - refreshNow()
  - useColorPolicy()
}

class Clock {
  + {static} instance()
  + addClockListener()
}

Cell <|.left. Neighborhood
Cell <|.. Resident
Neighborhood "<U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003>1" *-left-> "<U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003>64" Cell
Universe "1<U+2003>" -right-> "1<U+2003>" Cell
Universe .left.> Clock : <<use>>
Universe ..> Resident : <U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><U+2003><<create, use>>
CellColorPolicy <|.right. FixedColorPolicy
CellColorPolicy <|.. CyclingColorPolicy
Resident --> "\n1" CellColorPolicy
Universe ..> FixedColorPolicy : <<create>>
Universe ..> CyclingColorPolicy : <<create>>


note right of Resident
  redraw()와 colorAt()이
  colorPolicy.colorOf(age)로 색을 받는다.
  colorAt()은 통계 기능이,
  holdNextState()와 heldThisGeneration은
  Freezing 기능이 더했다
end note
note left of Universe
  Resident를 프로토타입으로 판을 만들고,
  시계에 틱 리스너를 등록한다.
  Color 메뉴에서 규칙을 만들어
  useColorPolicy()로 바꿔 끼우고,
  틱마다 colorChangesWithAge()에 묻는다
end note
@enduml
